# No package's install scripts run on `npm ci` or `npm install`, here, in CI or on the deploy Mac.
# Nothing in the build, tests or deploy needs one: every native part these packages use comes
# prebuilt. One side effect: `npm pack` and `npm publish` skip `prepack`, so run `npm run build`
# in the package first (CONTRIBUTING.md). Kept in place by bboard-ui/src/install-scripts.test.ts.
ignore-scripts=true
